---
layout: base.njk
title: "Contact Us"
description: "Contact Stepping Stones Nutrition in Cary, NC to schedule an appointment or ask a question."
permalink: /contact-us/
---
<div class="hero">
  <h1>Contact Us</h1>
</div>

<section class="block">
  <h4>Send Us a Message</h4>
  <div class="contact-block">
    <p><strong>Name</strong></p>
    <p><strong>Email</strong></p>
    <p><strong>Message</strong></p>
    <p><em>Contact form &mdash; wire this up to your form backend (e.g. the same Google Form / Apps Script pattern used elsewhere) once you're ready to collect submissions.</em></p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <h4>Now accepting new patients for in-person &amp; telehealth appointments.</h4>
  <p>If you aren't sure if nutrition therapy is right for you, please call us to find out more. At the very least, we can help point you in the right direction.</p>
  <p>Contact us if you have any questions and to schedule an appointment.</p>
</section>

<div class="contact-block">
  <h4>{{ site.name }}</h4>
  <p>{{ site.address.line1 }}<br>{{ site.address.line2 }}</p>
  <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
  <p>Phone: <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></p>
</div>

<div class="cta">
  <h2>{{ site.apptCta.heading }}</h2>
  <p>{{ site.apptCta.text }}</p>
</div>
